#: inc/admin/option-page-switcher.php:340
msgid "Custom CSS"
msgstr "Kustom CSS"

#: inc/admin/option-page-switcher.php:342
msgid "Set custom CSS: "
msgstr "Mengatur CSS khusus: "

#: inc/admin/option-page-switcher.php:345
msgid ""
"The field below allows you to add custom CSS code that will run on all pages."
msgstr ""
"Kolom di bawah ini memungkinkan Anda untuk menambahkan kode CSS khusus yang "
