msgstr "tengah bawah layar."

#: inc/admin/option-page-switcher.php:440
msgid "Bottom left: "
msgstr "Kiri bawah: "

#: inc/admin/option-page-switcher.php:441
msgid "bottom left of the screen."
msgstr "kiri bawah layar."

#: inc/admin/option-page-switcher.php:444
msgid "None: "
msgstr "Tidak ada: "

#: inc/admin/option-page-switcher.php:445
msgid "the switcher is not inserted automatically."
msgstr "pengalih tidak dimasukkan secara otomatis."

#: inc/admin/option-page-switcher.php:457
msgid "Shortcode switcher: "
msgstr "Pengalih kode pendek: "

#: inc/admin/option-page-switcher.php:469
msgid ""
"If you want to insert the language switcher only in certain places on your "
"website, you can use the shortcode provided for this purpose. Note that in "
"this case, the previous option should be \"None\". This method is ideal for "
"placing the switcher where you want it, whether you are using a Gutenberg "
"block-based theme (FSE), a classic theme or even a page or theme builder like "
"Divi, Elementor..."
msgstr ""
"Jika Anda ingin menyisipkan pengalih bahasa hanya di tempat-tempat tertentu "
"di situs web Anda, Anda dapat menggunakan kode pendek yang disediakan untuk "
